  "tagline": "Long-running pure-Java SQL database with strong SQL:2023 coverage, used embedded and in LibreOffice.",
  "description": "HyperSQL (HSQLDB) is a Java relational database that has been in continuous development since 2001, maintained largely by Fred Toussi and the hsql Development Group. It can run in-memory, file-based embedded or as a server, and it is notable for unusually thorough SQL standard support, including SQL:2023 features, MVCC, and Java routines. It ships as the embedded engine for LibreOffice/OpenOffice Base and is widely used for tests in Java projects. Releases are infrequent (2.7.4 in October 2024) but source activity continues, so treat it as stable and maintained rather than fast-moving.",
